The MIT licence requires that its copyright notice and permission notice be
included in all copies or substantial portions of the software. A production
build strips comments, so if this application is ever distributed as a product
rather than served as a personal site, ship the dependency licence texts
alongside it — `npx license-checker --production` will collect them.

The Nunito typeface is loaded from Google Fonts at runtime and is licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1. It is not redistributed by this repository.

